    "detailed_description": "A tower defense game awaits you in which it is important to make the right decisions. When do you buy more weapons and when do you save money? <br />\r\nThere are a lot of options to use your money such as diamonds, blacksmiths, shrines, enchantments or investments.<br />\r\nBuy weapons and defend the life crystal. Improve weapons in the forge, with diamonds or with enchantments<br />\r\nTry yourself in different difficulty levels, earn all the medals and set huge high scores.<br />\r\nFor more wariation in the runs, there are many different classes that massively influence the course of the game. (guner, investor, wizard, ...)",
    "about_the_game": "A tower defense game awaits you in which it is important to make the right decisions. When do you buy more weapons and when do you save money? <br />\r\nThere are a lot of options to use your money such as diamonds, blacksmiths, shrines, enchantments or investments.<br />\r\nBuy weapons and defend the life crystal. Improve weapons in the forge, with diamonds or with enchantments<br />\r\nTry yourself in different difficulty levels, earn all the medals and set huge high scores.<br />\r\nFor more wariation in the runs, there are many different classes that massively influence the course of the game. (guner, investor, wizard, ...)",
    "short_description": "a tower defense game in a 3D environment. Unique interface design and damage system which significantly increases the strategy factor. With a choice of 4 different weapons and a lot of improvement options, this game is perfect for putting your strategic skills to the test.",
